Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:01.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(艾利法斯)让我来给你看看吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.18,0:00:03.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那奇迹的世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.40,0:00:05.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超越极限的化身
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.88,0:00:09.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阶级13的怪兽 超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.04,0:00:11.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)不… 不可能…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.77,0:00:15.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的存在吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.50,0:00:18.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 我的回合！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.86,0:00:21.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动墓地中星光之力的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.63,0:00:24.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为抽卡的代替
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.18,0:00:25.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将这张卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.30,0:00:26.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}放回自己的手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.85,0:00:27.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以做到！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.45,0:00:29.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又是 那张卡！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.07,0:00:32.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗怪兽的最高等级是12。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.03,0:00:36.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话虽如此阶级12也未必就是顶点！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.80,0:00:40.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 发动升阶魔法 星光之力\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.03,0:00:43.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以将自己场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.10,0:00:45.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级最高的怪兽超量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.58,0:00:47.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最多2只进行升阶。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.97,0:00:51.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级12的以太·马赫斯{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.54,0:00:53.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重构为超量网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.61,0:00:56.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}升阶超量变换！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.20,0:01:02.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(艾莉法斯)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.03,0:01:03.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超越极限，不断升阶。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.50,0:01:06.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这才是星光世界所追求的决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.17,0:01:12.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！新秩序 等级13！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.26,0:01:17.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}主宰秩序的清净之… 志向啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.39,0:01:21.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}迈向更高的巅峰让世界回归应有的姿态！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.60,0:01:23.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}睁大眼睛看好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.28,0:01:25.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是我们的意志
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.40,0:01:28.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以太·阿门！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.38,0:01:36.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是… 等级13的怪兽超量！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.38,0:03:13.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)怎… 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.28,0:03:13.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底…。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.50,0:03:16.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(V)能量已经超出了装置的极限。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.04,0:03:19.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再这样下去的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.18,0:03:26.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(轨道7)快斗大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.65,0:03:27.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再这样下去我们也会{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.88,0:03:29.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被卷入爆炸之中
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.11,0:03:29.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.24,0:03:30.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.08,0:03:34.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从这里逃出去吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.24,0:03:37.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？那游马呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.13,0:03:39.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马要怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.73,0:03:41.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相信游马……相信那家伙吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.24,0:03:44.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.38,0:03:48.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Rank13的怪兽Exceeds？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.70,0:03:51.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马啊Rank-Up是必然之事。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.68,0:03:55.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一个世界要扩张是有极限的。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.28,0:04:00.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在极限之中闭塞感和封闭的想法蔓延{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.79,0:04:03.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终将让世界腐朽下去。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.92,0:04:05.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了超越那个极限
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.78,0:04:07.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就需要升级！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.11,0:04:10.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么啊 超越极限什么的。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.91,0:04:12.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那不就 跟嗑药嗨起来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.39,0:04:13.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是一回事吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.06,0:04:15.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那不一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.78,0:04:18.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能够升级的只有被选中的灵魂。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.42,0:04:23.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那这么说{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没被选中的灵魂又该怎么办啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.53,0:04:28.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是指和艾娜一起的那些人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.62,0:04:29.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[监视器]那些人{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.99,0:04:31.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样都无所谓
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.00,0:04:31.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是这个意思吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.64,0:04:35.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[监视器]只挑优等生剩下的就抛弃。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.66,0:04:37.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[监视器]大家明明都一样{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.09,0:04:37.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不就是说
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.83,0:04:38.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根本不可能拥有可能性吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.18,0:04:42.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样的世界 我绝对 不承认！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.90,0:04:45.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并不是希望你认同。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.73,0:04:47.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只是 想让你知道而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.44,0:04:48.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在最后。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.74,0:04:52.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么都不知情就消散实在是太可怜了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.15,0:04:56.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 决斗继续！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.82,0:04:59.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 以太·阿蒙的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.62,0:05:01.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽召唤成功的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.99,0:05:03.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.05,0:05:04.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只怪兽超量素材和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.71,0:05:06.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与这只怪兽的阶级之差{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.86,0:05:08.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从对方卡组吸收卡片{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.25,0:05:10.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成为以太·阿蒙的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.43,0:05:11.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量单元！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.42,0:05:14.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇·胜利与
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.82,0:05:16.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以太·阿蒙的阶级差是8！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.36,0:05:18.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(艾利法斯)因此从你的卡组中
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.31,0:05:20.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有8张卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.49,0:05:22.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变为以太·阿蒙的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.08,0:05:23.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量单元！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.91,0:05:26.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊！我的卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.64,0:05:35.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 以太·阿蒙的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.06,0:05:38.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量单元的数量乘以100点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.81,0:05:40.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升攻击力！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.47,0:05:43.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量单元有11个。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.82,0:05:45.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 提升1100点！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.66,0:05:48.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 由于升阶优势的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.86,0:05:49.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.99,0:05:51.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用升阶卡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.25,0:05:53.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤出怪物超量时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.96,0:05:55.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽1张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.85,0:05:58.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闪耀抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.77,0:06:02.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来这就是最后的攻击了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.14,0:06:05.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以太·阿蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.27,0:06:07.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对希望·胜利 攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.04,0:06:09.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这个瞬间 永续魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.63,0:06:12.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级·支配的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.70,0:06:13.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗的怪兽的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.88,0:06:15.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级差乘以1000点{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.78,0:06:19.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级较低一方的怪兽的攻击力下降！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.44,0:06:22.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以太阿蒙和希望皇·胜利的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.96,0:06:23.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级差是8！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.46,0:06:26.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此希望皇·胜利的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.26,0:06:28.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力下降8000点！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.79,0:06:31.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力……又变成零了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.58,0:06:34.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是等级提升带来的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.51,0:06:36.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和你的压倒性差距。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.56,0:06:38.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再见了，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.95,0:06:42.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，动手吧。以太阿蒙！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.51,0:06:47.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}手牌是零……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.75,0:06:50.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在 我没有能防住那家伙攻击的手段……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.83,0:06:51.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.97,0:06:52.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（彩虹栗子球）栗栗～！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.90,0:06:55.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这……这样啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.90,0:06:55.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.33,0:06:58.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}幻影·雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.17,0:07:00.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡的效果是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.02,0:07:02.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将自己场上的怪兽超量素材释放{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.58,0:07:05.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这个回合的结束阶段从被释放的怪兽中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.41,0:07:07.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将阶级更低的怪兽超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.76,0:07:09.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从墓地特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.63,0:07:11.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是不死心！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.74,0:07:13.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 以太阿蒙。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.34,0:07:15.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对九十九游马 直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.91,0:07:20.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从墓地 将虹栗子球以守备表示特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.86,0:07:21.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(虹栗子球)栗！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.78,0:07:22.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.02,0:07:25.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}栗～！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.54,0:07:27.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当我受到直接攻击时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.86,0:07:30.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将墓地的虹栗子球特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.67,0:07:36.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.83,0:07:38.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那只怪兽，就让它消失吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.07,0:07:41.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}库哩～！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.86,0:07:45.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抱歉了，虹库里波。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.62,0:07:53.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就这样，回合结束…。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.97,0:07:58.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明是守备表示的怪兽被破坏了啊{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.76,0:08:00.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这冲击可真够大的。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.23,0:08:03.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这个回合结束时发动天堂·雷的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.99,0:08:05.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从解放的怪兽中
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.13,0:08:06.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将阶级更低的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.46,0:08:09.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从墓地特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.82,0:08:12.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然不惜降低阶级来特殊召唤…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.13,0:08:16.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了夺回阿斯特拉尔我什么都愿意做！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.99,0:08:18.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我绝对不会输！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.16,0:08:21.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}愚蠢…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.76,0:08:23.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动以太·阿门的新效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.39,0:08:26.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当对手将怪兽超量
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.14,0:08:27.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤时。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.06,0:08:29.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.39,0:08:30.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡和
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.13,0:08:31.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那只怪兽的阶级差值{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.08,0:08:33.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方卡组的卡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.32,0:08:35.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成先史遗产 阿门的上叠单位。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.50,0:08:38.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与你的怪兽的阶级差是 ９。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.95,0:08:42.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 将９张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.53,0:08:44.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从你的卡组吸收{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.68,0:08:46.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为上叠单位。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.25,0:08:48.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先史遗产 阿门的上叠单位
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.58,0:08:49.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}增加后{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.62,0:08:51.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力上升 900点。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.75,0:08:55.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力7000…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.15,0:08:57.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明白了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.98,0:08:59.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是赢不了我的。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.08,0:09:01.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.23,0:09:12.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.23,0:09:15.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.39,0:09:18.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.88,0:09:22.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我赢不了吗…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.03,0:09:24.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你也会……。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.91,0:09:28.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和你之间的记忆全都会失去吗……。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.16,0:09:32.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开什么玩笑……。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.82,0:09:34.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Astral……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.11,0:09:36.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙又狂妄{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.70,0:09:37.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又任性
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.04,0:09:39.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总是高高在上……。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.73,0:09:41.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是……但是啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.18,0:09:43.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是你决定了我的命运。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.37,0:09:45.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的人生……。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.31,0:09:46.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Astral。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.53,0:09:48.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在你是我……。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.36,0:09:50.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是我的全部。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.20,0:09:51.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以……。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.08,0:09:54.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以我……。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.41,0:09:58.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不能失去你。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.65,0:09:59.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不能输……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.39,0:10:02.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对不能输！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.18,0:10:03.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.37,0:10:05.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.56,0:10:06.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样啊，星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.15,0:10:08.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你要把力量借给我吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.44,0:10:10.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.82,0:10:13.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最强决斗者的决斗，一切都是必然。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.64,0:10:16.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就连抽卡，也是由决斗者创造的。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.12,0:10:19.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闪光抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.96,0:10:23.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（艾利法斯）很久以前
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.52,0:10:27.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当上千主上和星光体战斗之时。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.24,0:10:53.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会吧…。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.50,0:11:00.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了啊，艾利法斯…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.60,0:11:04.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是我和星光体的羁绊之力！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.69,0:11:07.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}降阶魔法 努梅隆·四发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.65,0:11:09.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.39,0:11:11.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让希望皇霍普降阶{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.83,0:11:15.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将全新的霍普特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.33,0:11:17.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然还能降阶！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.79,0:11:19.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用希望皇霍普
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.38,0:11:21.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重构叠光网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.53,0:11:24.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量变换！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.14,0:11:33.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 阶级1 No.39！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.02,0:11:39.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望之光… 向着进化突进！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.52,0:11:42.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}解放原初的记忆吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.75,0:11:44.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}天衣无缝之力
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.29,0:11:47.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇 霍普鲁兹！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.48,0:11:51.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（艾娜）啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.72,0:11:53.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道 那位是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.56,0:12:00.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}愚蠢… 刚才那道光芒虽然觉得莫非是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.64,0:12:04.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 发动以太阿门的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.68,0:12:05.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以太阿门与
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.93,0:12:07.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的怪兽的阶级差值{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.09,0:12:09.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将你的卡组的卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.49,0:12:12.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为以太阿门的 超量单元。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.09,0:12:15.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阶级差为 12！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.38,0:12:19.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 12个超量单元
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.11,0:12:20.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被追加！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.37,0:12:24.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 以太阿门的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.07,0:12:26.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再 上升1200点！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.20,0:12:29.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 你的卡组的卡就 归零了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.79,0:12:30.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}手牌也是零。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.36,0:12:32.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难得的闪亮抽卡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.85,0:12:33.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来也白费了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.71,0:12:36.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，并没有白费。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.30,0:12:38.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.78,0:12:40.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说世界要超越极限
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.58,0:12:42.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就需要升阶{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.56,0:12:43.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才不是那样！ 如果
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.83,0:12:45.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}非要说需要升阶的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.25,0:12:47.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那也是为了活着的人！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.18,0:12:51.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光跟你们这种家伙完全不一样！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.01,0:12:52.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.67,0:12:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，不只是那家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.54,0:12:56.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特、鲨鱼，还有我在决斗中
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.64,0:12:58.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遇到过的所有同伴！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.43,0:13:01.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他们每一个人一直都在痛苦着！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.64,0:13:03.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和自己本身拼命地战斗着！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.32,0:13:06.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管是谁，心里不都是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.38,0:13:09.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}善心与恶心在互相战斗吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.63,0:13:12.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 只要不从这里逃避{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.26,0:13:14.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定不管什么事 都能重新来过！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.44,0:13:17.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和谁都能互相理解！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.37,0:13:21.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连每个人的痛苦都不去看什么都不了解{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.86,0:13:24.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真正的升级什么的根本不可能做到！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.17,0:13:26.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然 你……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.80,0:13:29.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊～ 希望芦笋！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.94,0:13:31.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击以太杏仁！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.43,0:13:33.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.04,0:13:35.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力500 竟然敢打我的怪兽！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.07,0:13:38.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个瞬间 希望芦笋的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.38,0:13:41.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 与怪兽艾克西斯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.12,0:13:41.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行战斗时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.34,0:13:43.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将超量单元
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.77,0:13:45.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给对手1个{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.67,0:13:46.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使攻击无效
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.07,0:13:49.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这回合 荷普露兹的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.71,0:13:50.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使战斗无效的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.94,0:13:52.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与对手怪兽的等级差{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.85,0:13:54.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}×100的攻击力。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.91,0:13:56.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级差是 12。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.54,0:13:58.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此攻击力是 1200！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.04,0:14:01.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种程度的提升能有什么用！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.83,0:14:02.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.99,0:14:05.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再 将荷普露兹的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.20,0:14:06.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}乘以你怪兽的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.34,0:14:08.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量素材的数量！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.08,0:14:11.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以太亚门鸟的超量素材是 33。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.04,0:14:15.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 是33倍的攻击力！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.68,0:14:22.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(艾莉法斯)攻击力 39600！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.35,0:14:24.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.80,0:14:25.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.18,0:14:27.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}荷普露兹的战斗已经结束了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.06,0:14:29.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那可不一定哦？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.14,0:14:32.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}速攻魔法 双重·提升·机会 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.70,0:14:35.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在怪兽的攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.60,0:14:36.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被无效的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.23,0:14:40.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将无效了攻击的怪兽的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变为２倍
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.66,0:14:42.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并使其可以再次攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.22,0:14:46.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力 79200！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.28,0:14:49.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是 我和星光体一路战斗过来的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.02,0:14:50.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗的结晶！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.72,0:14:53.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普雷兹 最后的攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.06,0:14:57.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑·雷兹·斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.37,0:15:03.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是 引导这个世界的新之光。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.53,0:15:19.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 谢谢你。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.34,0:15:24.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 赢了吗…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.62,0:15:36.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 看来我的使命已经结束了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.89,0:15:37.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}艾利法斯…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.23,0:15:44.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家 就像游马给予了我们力量一样{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.28,0:15:49.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次轮到我们轮到我们给游马力量了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.18,0:16:02.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.60,0:16:06.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光界的新的决断已经下达了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.11,0:16:41.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.74,0:16:45.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.78,0:16:50.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我能感觉到。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.11,0:16:53.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的心跳，你的温暖。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.78,0:16:54.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.32,0:17:01.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.78,0:17:03.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.60,0:17:05.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我再也不会松手了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.54,0:17:08.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对不会再松手了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.80,0:17:11.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以你哪儿都不许去！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.11,0:17:15.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不要走啊，星光！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.34,0:17:19.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)在那前方是异晶界。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.51,0:17:20.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.83,0:17:21.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我居然是异晶人……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.41,0:17:23.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然是异晶人。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.70,0:17:27.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 星光体 快斗…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.61,0:17:30.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和他们之间的羁绊要我亲手斩断
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.03,0:17:31.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我…做不到。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.14,0:17:34.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（多鲁贝）去见他们吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.38,0:17:37.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（多鲁贝）去见我们真正的同伴。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.31,0:17:41.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在那里，有你失去的一切。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.93,0:17:52.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里是？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.38,0:17:54.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.21,0:17:57.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们两个，回头看看吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.38,0:18:00.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家都在等着你回来。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.92,0:18:04.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}王。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.07,0:18:08.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}欢迎回来，我的王。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.67,0:18:12.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}王！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.57,0:18:14.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们…。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.03,0:18:16.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}欢迎回来，国王。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.06,0:18:25.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安世界是连接我们灵魂的奇迹空间。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.33,0:18:28.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家…依然还把我…。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.17,0:18:30.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多鲁贝)星光界与
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.96,0:18:32.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异晶界的战斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.78,0:18:35.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到其中一方毁灭才会结束吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.67,0:18:39.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再这样下去 会再次发生和你的过去一样的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.39,0:18:43.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)和那时候一样…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.76,0:18:48.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只有你 才能终结这场战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.43,0:18:52.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}守护这个世界 是我的使命…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.16,0:18:53.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.33,0:18:55.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 即使那意味着{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.87,0:18:56.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要斩断你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.97,0:18:58.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与游马他们的羁绊…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.04,0:19:03.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光界与异晶界的战斗…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.41,0:19:17.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以我自己的方式做个了断就是我的命运。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.19,0:19:19.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.60,0:19:23.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 会追随凌牙的命运直到天涯海角…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.19,0:19:28.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 你们是纳修和梅拉古！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.81,0:19:31.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凌牙）游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.09,0:19:35.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的未来…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.09,0:19:39.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}走吧！ 和你们一起！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.98,0:19:41.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.34,0:19:44.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一直都能听见你的声音。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.36,0:19:48.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这身体看来相当乱来过啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.92,0:19:50.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼！ 这点算什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.78,0:19:52.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.15,0:19:56.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干嘛啊 真恶心。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.27,0:20:01.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来没有时间{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.12,0:20:04.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}沉浸在重逢的喜悦里了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.00,0:20:06.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎!?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.56,0:20:13.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那 那是什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.77,0:20:16.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异晶界里 强大的力量正在逐渐苏醒。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.26,0:20:19.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说 被封印的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.69,0:20:22.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异晶界之神 唐·千尊…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.13,0:20:24.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唐·千尊？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.79,0:20:28.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是很久以前 我曾交战过的对手。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.31,0:20:31.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光界
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.61,0:20:32.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如此强大的力量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.75,0:20:34.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恐怕 人类世界也
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.27,0:20:35.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经受到了影响。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.49,0:20:38.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}必须尽快 回到地上。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.05,0:20:39.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把这个拿着。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.66,0:20:43.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光界因游马的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.82,0:20:45.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}获得了新生{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.53,0:20:48.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但从异晶界的威胁中拯救这个世界{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.22,0:20:50.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的使命并没有改变。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.01,0:20:56.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定会找到的我和游马一起 创造新的未来…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.58,0:20:59.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯 干吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.82,0:21:01.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 出发吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.49,0:21:07.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.04,0:21:10.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}艾利法斯，各种事都谢谢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.79,0:21:20.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当威胁世界的危机降临之时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.81,0:21:24.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拯救它的英雄就会出现。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.52,0:21:26.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是泽阿尔。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.55,0:21:29.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜托了，游马，阿斯特拉尔。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.61,0:21:36.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(一马)那家伙，把这个世界
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.32,0:21:37.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}转眼间就改变了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.28,0:21:39.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那孩子，长大了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.57,0:21:43.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯，游马他还会变得更强更强。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.26,0:21:46.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是啊。因为那孩子…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.61,0:21:49.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马选择了我们。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.45,0:21:51.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去吧，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.83,0:21:57.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(咚·萨赞多)完成了，No.们。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.25,0:22:02.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔地面被混沌笼罩的时候到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.62,0:23:43.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.16,0:23:47.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.70,0:23:50.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.30,0:23:52.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.24,0:23:55.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.65,0:23:57.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.63,0:23:59.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.80,0:24:01.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.01,0:24:05.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.92,0:24:07.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
